{"_id":"6a2ff0132204ffbc59e5a3d6","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"cD139cRk1xj2ip-o_078l","description":"# Pandas\n\nPandas integrates with SQL through `pd.read_sql()`, which executes a SQL query against a database connection and returns the result as a DataFrame. This allows analysts to leverage SQL for initial data extraction and filtering while using Pandas for downstream manipulation and analysis.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"pandas.read_sql","url":"https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.read_sql.html","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb9c"},{"type":"video","title":"Read Write Data From Database (read_sql, to_sql)","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M-4EpNdlSuY","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb9d"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:29:07.043Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/cD139cRk1xj2ip-o_078l.md"}